---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Le deuxième arrêt">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg" style="background-image:url('/img/gare-saint-lazare.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="hero-scrim"></div>
    <div class="hero-fade"></div>

    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1>Le deuxième arrêt</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">Ogni film merita una seconda fermata.</p>
    </div>

    <a href="#home" class="hero-menu">Menu</a>

    <div class="hero-date">
      <span>8 Agosto 2026</span>
      <span class="hero-time">04:41 — Roma</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="home" class="home">
    <div class="home-bg" style="background-image:url('/img/monet-bg.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="home-fade-top"></div>

    <div class="home-inner">
      <div class="mission">
        <p>Ogni anno in Italia si finiscono film che non vedrà nessuno.</p>
        <p>Non film sbagliati. Film compiuti, pagati, premiati dentro sale da duecento posti — e poi fermi.</p>
        <p>Noi torniamo a guardarli. E facciamo in modo che li guardino gli altri.</p>
        <p class="mission-note">Per gli autori e i produttori che hanno un'opera ferma.</p>
      </div>

      <figure class="quote">
        <blockquote>La pittura è silenziosa, il cinema ha una voce che viene dal colore e dalla luce.</blockquote>
        <div class="quote-rule"></div>
        <figcaption>Michelangelo Antonioni</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <nav class="site-nav">
        <a href="#">Il Treno</a>
        <a href="/rubriche">Rubriche</a>
        <a href="#">News</a>
        <a href="#">Autori Emergenti</a>
        <a href="/passeggeri">Passeggeri</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    height: 100vh;
    min-height: 620px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #0f0d0b;
  }
  .hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
  }
  .hero-scrim {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(12,10,8,0.42) 0%, rgba(12,10,8,0.34) 45%, rgba(12,10,8,0.72) 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero-fade {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
    height: 14vh;
    min-height: 90px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, #0f0d0b 92%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero-content {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 22px;
    padding: 0 32px;
    pointer-events: none;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .hero-content h1 {
    font-family: 'Parisienne', cursive;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(56px, 8.5vw, 112px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    color: #f7f1e4;
    margin: 0 0 0 0;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.55);
  }
  .hero-subtitle {
    margin: -8vh 0 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(18px, 1.9vw, 26px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: #fdf8ec;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.85), 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.75);
  }
  .hero-menu {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 38px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(247,241,228,0.82);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(247,241,228,0.35);
    padding-bottom: 6px;
    width: fit-content;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .hero-date {
    position: absolute;
    right: clamp(20px,4vw,48px);
    top: clamp(28px,5vh,56px);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 2px;
    padding: 14px 22px;
    background: rgba(74,144,196,0.4);
    border: 1px solid rgba(200,232,255,0.35);
    border-radius: 8px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    text-align: right;
  }
  .hero-date span:first-child {
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: #fdf8ec;
  }
  .hero-time {
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: rgba(253,248,236,0.75);
  }

  .home {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100vh;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: clamp(72px,12vh,140px) 40px clamp(72px,12vh,132px);
  }
  .home-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
  }
  .home-fade-top {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; right: 0; top: 0;
    height: 14vh;
    min-height: 90px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0f0d0b, transparent);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .home-inner {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 64px;
  }

  .mission {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    max-width: min(85vw, 1000px);
  }
  .mission p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: min(1.3vw, 20px);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #2b2620;
    text-align: center;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .mission-note {
    margin-top: 24px !important;
    font-size: min(1vw, 16px) !important;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #7a7266 !important;
  }

  .quote {
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
  }
  .quote blockquote {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: min(70vw, 900px);
    font-size: min(3.4vw, 48px);
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    font-family: 'Cormorant', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #2b2620;
    text-align: center;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .quote-rule {
    width: clamp(80px,10vw,160px);
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(43,38,32,0.45), transparent);
  }
  .quote figcaption {
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-size: 16px;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #4a443a;
  }

  .site-nav {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    row-gap: 14px;
    column-gap: clamp(24px, 3vw, 48px);
  }
  .site-nav a {
    font-size: clamp(15px, 1.35vw, 19px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 3.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #2b2620;
    padding: 6px 2px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
  }
  .site-nav a:hover {
    color: #000000;
    border-bottom-color: rgba(43,38,32,0.55);
  }
</style>
